Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:22:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Persist recently picked colors in localStorage

Add a small storage module that keeps the last 8 picked colors per color
picker type (stroke, background, ...), most recent first, under the
`excalidraw-recent-colors` localStorage key. Picking a color again moves
it to the front instead of duplicating it, and unreadable or corrupted
data is treated as an empty list.
